        {
          "_key": "00000000003b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000003a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El encanto del desierto blanco"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000044",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000003c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Farafra es ahora famosa por el impresionante Desierto Blanco, al noreste, una zona protegida de paisajes surrealistas."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Los exploradores de safaris suelen visitar Ain Hadra, un manantial de la época romano-bizantina, donde las palmeras y los antiguos tiestos de cerámica cuentan "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000040",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000003f"
              ],
              "text": "historias de un tiempo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000041",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " pasado."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000042",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000043",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " El manantial forma parte del pintoresco Ain el-Wadi, antaño un asentamiento romano, cuyos campos son ahora reliquias de la historia. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000003f",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/explorando-la-gran-esfinge-de-guiza/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/explorando-la-gran-esfinge-de-guiza",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000046",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000045",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Huellas de antiguas civilizaciones"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000050",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000047",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Si nos "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000049",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000048"
              ],
              "text": "aventuramos"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " un poco más, Wadi Abu Hannis revela restos de estructuras romanas de adobe, y 70 km al norte, el Valle Oculto, o Wadi el-Obeid, revela vestigios prehistóricos."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Una misión italo-egipcia ha desenterrado pruebas de un poblado neolítico del octavo milenio a.C., que ofrece una visión de la vida de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000004d"
              ],
              "text": "los primeros habitantes pastorales del desierto"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " libio. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000048",
